            <div xml:id="d383">

                <pb facs="0474" n="462" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg462"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.199/65: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">Then in France, to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">St.
                                Jean de Luz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-12-07T11:00:00+00:00">December 7, 1937—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 7—9 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>408. Bay’s telegram of December 6, 11 a.m., and 4th paragraph of my telegram No.
                    407, December 6, 7 p.m.<anchor n="14" xml:id="d383-f1"/></p>
                <p>Unless otherwise instructed Chapman will not depart for the United States
                    December 8, 10 p.m. as contemplated but will proceed with further endeavors to
                    obtain permission to return to Bilbao.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
